AB  - This article outlines a structured approach to writing clear and actionable project objectives. It explains the difference between goals and objectives, emphasizes the SMART criteria, and provides steps to create effective objectives. Key insights include avoiding vagueness, ensuring measurability, and aligning objectives with organizational strategy.
